===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sv|hufvud}} {{qualifier|obsolete since 1906}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|sv}} {{m|non|hǫfuð}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|sv}} {{m|gem-pro|*hafudą}} or {{m|gem-pro|*habudą}}, northern form of {{m|gem-pro|*haubudą}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sv}} {{m|ine-pro|*kauput-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kaput-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhʉːˌvɵd/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-huvud.ogg|audio|lang=sv}}

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|n}}

# {{lb|sv|anatomy}} [[head]]; a [[body part]]
# [[head]]; the [[topmost]] part of some things
# [[head]]; the [[end]] of a [[tool]] used for [[strike|striking]]
# [[head]]; the [[blunt]] [[end]] of a [[fastener]]
# (''in compounds'') [[main]], [[principal]]

